    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A mounting boss sized for a heat-set threaded insert (or a self-tapping screw) — a printed cylinder whose bore accepts a brass insert melted flush with a soldering iron, giving a reusable metal thread. Metric sizes M2–M6 with correct heat-set bore diameters. Standalone-flange or in-wall mounts, optional gusset ribs, and a multi-boss strip.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un poste de montaje dimensionado para un inserto roscado termofusible (o un tornillo autorroscante) — un cilindro impreso cuyo barreno acepta un inserto de latón fundido al ras con un cautín, dando una rosca metálica reutilizable. Tamaños métricos M2–M6 con diámetros de barreno correctos. Montajes con brida independiente o en pared, nervios opcionales y una tira de varios postes.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/threaded-boss.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": ["boss", "threaded-insert", "heat-set", "standoff", "mount", "insert", "hyperobject", "commons"],
